### Get all medications from Pharmacy Department
GET http://localhost:4006/pharmacy/medications
Content-Type: application/json

### Add a new medication to Pharmacy Department inventory
POST http://localhost:4006/pharmacy/medications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Azithromycin 250mg",
  "code": "MED-005",
  "stockQuantity": 120,
  "reorderThreshold": 15,
  "price": 24.50
}

### Create a new prescription in Pharmacy Department
POST http://localhost:4006/pharmacy/prescriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "223e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174006",
  "medicationId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "quantity": 2,
  "dosage": "1 pill twice daily for 5 days"
}

### Dispense medication for prescription
PUT http://localhost:4006/pharmacy/prescriptions/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/dispense

### Get prescriptions for a specific patient
GET http://localhost:4006/pharmacy/prescriptions/patient/223e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174006
